@BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000/api/authentication

### Register
POST {{BASE_URL}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Thai",
  "lastName": "Thai",
  "email": "you@example.com",
  "password": "your-password"
}

### Login (returns accessToken in the body, refresh token in a cookie)
# @name login
POST {{BASE_URL}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "you@example.com",
  "password": "your-password"
}

### Refresh (uses the httpOnly refresh_token cookie set by login)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/refresh
